## 1 Preamble
######
Safety arrangements and guidelines/regulations in InnoWing are overseen by the Safety Working Group under the Executive Committee of InnoWing.
In this document, the arrangements and guidelines/regulations are described and the principal safety responsibilities of different staff are also indicated.
