## 4 Fire Safety
######
### 4.1 Escape Routes
######
A poster on the escape route is posted near the exit of each workplace. Technician-in-charge should inform the users of the workplace with the escape route before they use the workplace.
### 4.2 Emergency Evacuation
######
In an emergency, the technician-in-charge and the fire warden have TOTAL authority to evacuate the workplace. Evacuation orders MUST be followed. If the fire alarm is on, unless it is in testing mode, all individuals must evacuate immediately by following an escape route.
Back to the top
